#: src/Plugin.php:43
#: src/Plugin.php:43
msgid "This shop uses checkout block rules containing email addresses, names or billing addresses. For signed-in customers, both account and billing email addresses are checked. Rules are kept until an administrator removes them or uninstalls the plugin."
msgstr ""

#: src/Plugin.php:43
#: src/Plugin.php:43
msgid "If administrator notifications are enabled, matching checkout details (including account and billing email addresses, name, address, IP address, user agent, time and checkout URL without query parameters) are sent through this site's WordPress mail system. Mail retention is controlled by the shop and its mail provider. The plugin does not transmit data to Talistech or use an external tracking service."
msgstr ""

#: src/Plugin.php:43
#: src/Plugin.php:43
msgid "Notification limits store keyed IP hashes with a ten-minute validity and an hourly counter. Expired hashes are pruned on the next notification attempt, and all limiter data is removed when the plugin is uninstalled. Adapt this text to the shop's actual purpose, retention periods and privacy practices."
msgstr ""

